EXCEPTION — SAMPLE IMAGES ARE NOT COVERED BY THE MIT LICENSE

The files in the `demo/` folder and `docs/preview.jpg` are illustrations of
real people (the template author and their spouse). They are provided only so
the demo looks complete. They are NOT licensed for reuse, modification or
redistribution. All rights reserved, (c) 2026 Lim Hyun.

If you create your own invitation from this template, delete the `demo/`
folder and upload your own photos to `images/`.

예시 이미지 안내: `demo/` 폴더와 `docs/preview.jpg` 의 그림은 실제 인물(템플릿
제작자 부부)을 그린 것으로, MIT 라이선스에 포함되지 않습니다. 재사용·수정·배포할
